      55.25,
      501.46,
      297.77,
      572.53
    ],
    "text": "I, Nalaka Jude Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act. No. 28 of 1964 that the Lands by described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      585.46,
      297.78,
      656.53
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted in Advance Tracing No. GA/BDD/2019/1048 dated 29.01.2020 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village of 184A, Nayapamula in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Baddegama, in the District of Galle, Southern Province. The boundaries of the said land with following names and extents are as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      669.46,
      297.78,
      704.53
    ],
